# EZKL circuit build artifacts
# pk.key (proving key, ~150MB+) and the KZG SRS file are large and
# environment-specific — never commit these. vk.key, proof.json, and
# model.compiled are small (<100KB) and are committed as real, reusable
# artifacts.
circuits/*/pk.key
circuits/*/witness.json
circuits/*/kzg*.srs

